"- புதிய ச்பானிச், போர்த்துகீசியம் (பிரேசில்) மற்றும் ரச்ய மொழிபெயர்ப்பு"

#: changelogs/59.0.3.txt:1
#, max-length:500
msgctxt "changelogs/59.0.3.txt:1"
msgid ""
"- Now targeting API level 34 (Android 14)\n"
"- Added support for Codec2 audio codec\n"
"- Recording of next call is not cleared when call is closed\n"
"- Included also Dark Theme setting in backup file\n"
"- Upstream fix of re-INVITE (call hold/resume)"
